# Image pipeline (large binary assets - ~850MB)
# Numbered folders represent processing stages:
#   1-SCRAPED-RAW → 2-SCRAPED-PROCESSED → 3-COMPRESSED
#   4-AI-UPSCALED → 5-AI-GENERATED-R1 → 6-AI-GENERATED-R2 → 7-FINAL-MENU-IMAGES
# Final production images are in apps/web/public/gallery/ (committed)
data/

